# ElWarsha API

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) first.

Precedence: `docs/adr/*` > `AGENTS.md` > routed docs
([`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md),
[`docs/MODULE_MAP.md`](../../docs/MODULE_MAP.md),
[`docs/LEARNING.md`](../../docs/LEARNING.md),
[`docs/CURRICULUM.md`](../../docs/CURRICULUM.md)).

Do not invent Prisma, Auth0, GitHub, or OpenAPI fields. Contracts live in
`prisma/schema.prisma`, `packages/client/src/index.ts`, and `.env.example`.

If system shape changes, update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. If the reason changes,
add or update an ADR and a `docs/history/` entry.

Cohort assignments follow Coach then Pair in `docs/LEARNING.md`. Explicit
maintainer implementation requests use normal Ship mode.
